  "limits": "Ringings whose orbit exceeds 1500 vertices are refused (most H4 forms beyond the truncated 600-cell). Finding the cells scans every image of the four fundamental weights, which takes seconds for the larger H4 forms in CPython. Snub and other non-Wythoffian uniform polytopes are out of scope. A4, D4 and H4 coordinates come from a Cholesky factor of the Gram matrix, so their orientation is not axis-aligned.",
